#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:3 a800f0397b91467ca753473e63a68a52
msgid "Code signing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:6 0802f271df4b448f910d8afa50ec02bb
msgid ""
"All contributions to the Qubes OS :doc:`source code </developer/code/source-"
"code>` must be cryptographically signed by the author’s PGP key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:9 f25fe30434ce4a2bb45e2e526673545c
msgid "Generating a Key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:12 8c57370d1d1346bc93f321de6f280a07
msgid "(**Note:** If you already have a PGP key, you may skip this step.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:14 a9753eb1ce2b46838e3932acaa39064f
msgid ""
"Alex Cabal has written an excellent `guide <https://alexcabal.com/creating-"
"the-perfect-gpg-keypair/>`__ on creating a PGP keypair. Below, we reproduce "
"just the minimum steps in generating a keypair using GnuPG. Please read "
"Cabal’s full guide for further important details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:60 7d2226291c1444609a8667953c5c0720
msgid "Upload the Key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:63 db3c185514234355af90d30017bdc02a
msgid "For others to find the public key, please upload it to a server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:65 a8d5c3d6a982463fba3a5302557facf2
msgid ""
"Currently, `these <https://github.com/marmarek/signature-checker/blob/master/"
"check-git-signature#L133-L135>`__ are the recognized servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../developer/code/code-signing.rst:67 82ccd71a1f114a028f41d3fe45a76d7b
msgid "In the example below, we will use ``keyserver.ubuntu.com``."
msgstr ""

